ince Gary is young, he must be white.  \n   - **Conclusion:** Gary is white.\n\n4. **Apply Rule 11 (White things are blue):**  \n   - Since Gary is white, he must be blue.  \n   - **Conclusion:** Gary is blue.\n\n5. **Check for Conflicts:**  \n   - No rules contradict the chain of deductions (green \u2192 young \u2192 white \u2192 blue).  \n   - Fiona\u2019s attributes (cold but not explicitly green) do not affect Gary\u2019s status, as rules are applied consistently.\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nA) True",
