rom \"Red people are blue\" (statement 10), Harry is also blue.\n   - Being both blue and red, the rule \"Blue, red people are white\" (statement 14) applies, so Harry is white.\n\n2. **Determining Kindness**:\n   - Harry is white and rough (established above). The rule \"White, rough people are kind\" (statement 13) requires that Harry is kind.\n   - Therefore, Harry **is** kind.\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - The statement \"Harry is not kind\" directly contradicts the conclusion that Harry is kind. Thus, the statement is **false**.\n\n**Answer: B) False**",
