 the rule \"Quiet, kind things are rough,\" Fiona must be rough.\n   - Since Fiona is rough, the rule \"All rough things are round\" applies. Therefore, Fiona must be round.\n\n4. **Verification of Contradictions**:\n   - Fiona being round and rough does not contradict any other rules. The rule \"All round, rough things are young\" is satisfied because Fiona is already young.\n   - Fiona's furry status is not mentioned, and since Harry is the only one stated as furry, Fiona is not furry. This does not affect the conclusion.\n\n**Conclusion**: Fiona is round based on the given rules and inferences. Therefore, the statement \"Fiona is round\" is true.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
