 someone is rough and kind, then they are cold.\" Charlie is both rough and kind (from above), so he must be **cold**.\n\n3. **Final Inference**:\n   - **Rule 1**: \"All cold, big people are furry.\" Charlie is both cold (from Rule 6) and big (from Rule 7), so he must be **furry**.\n\n**Conclusion**: Charlie is furry. The statement is **true**.\n\nANSWER: A) True",
