ow\u2019s need for the bald eagle. The rule only imposes a condition on the bald eagle\u2019s age if the cow\u2019s needs are met, which is acceptable as no contradiction arises from this implication.\n\n4. **No Conflicts with Other Statements:**\n   - Other statements (e.g., the squirrel\u2019s needs, eating relationships) do not conflict with the conclusion that the cow needs the bald eagle. \n\nThus, the cow needing the bald eagle is **true** based on the given premises. \n\n**Answer:** A) True",
