plying Rule 5**:  \n   *\"If someone is blue and rough, then they are quiet.\"*  \n   Fiona is both blue and rough, so she must be **quiet**.\n5. **Applying Rule 8**:  \n   *\"If someone is quiet, then they are big.\"*  \n   Fiona\u2019s quietness requires her to be **big**.\n\nThis chain of logic (blue \u2192 cold \u2192 rough \u2192 quiet \u2192 big) is unbroken and follows all given rules. No contradictions or exceptions exist in the context to invalidate this conclusion. Thus, Fiona must be big.\n\n**Answer**: A) True",
