ding the dog). Thus, the conditional *If someone needs the dog then the dog is round* does not trigger, leaving the dog\u2019s roundness unknown.\n   - Even if the dog were round, this does not imply anything about the tiger\u2019s shape.\n\n4. **No Indirect Links to the Tiger\u2019s Roundness:**\n   - The tiger\u2019s roundness is never addressed through dependencies, actions, or other conditionals. The context offers no logical pathway to infer this attribute.\n\n**Conclusion:** Since there is no information about the tiger\u2019s roundness in the provided statements, the correct answer is **Unknown (C).**",
