h is consistent.\n   - **Rule 6**: \"Rough, white people are nice\" also confirms Harry\u2019s niceness, aligning with prior conclusions.\n   - **Rule 8**: \"Green people are nice\" is redundant since Harry is already nice via being white.\n\n**Conclusion**: Harry must be blue. Thus, the statement \"Harry is not blue\" is **false**.\n\n**Answer**: B) False",
