 explicitly listed as \"nice.\"\n\n2. **Application of Rule 8:**\n   Since Fiona is nice (given), Rule 8 requires her to be round. Therefore, Fiona **must be round**.\n\n3. **Analysis of the Statement:**\n   The question asks if \"Fiona is not round\" is true. Since Fiona must be round due to Rule 8, the statement **\"Fiona is not round\" is false.**\n\n4. **Additional Checks:**\n   - Fiona\u2019s other attributes (blue, smart) do not conflict with being round.\n   - Rule 5 (\"If someone is nice and round, then they are rough\") implies Fiona would also be rough, but this does not affect the conclusion about her being round.\n\n**Conclusion:** The statement \"Fiona is not round\" is **false**, so the correct answer is **B) False**.",
