d (given), so she must be **green**.\n4. **Rule 3:** Green people are young.  \n   \u2192 Fiona is green, so she must be **young**.\n5. **Rule 8:** Young people are cold.  \n   \u2192 Fiona is young, so she must be **cold**.\n\n### **Conclusion:**\nFiona is cold. Therefore, the statement \"Fiona is not cold\" is **false**.\n\n### **Answer:**\n**B) False**",
