tself.  \n  - **Statement 18:** If BE dislikes itself, it cannot eat the lion.  \n\n**Conclusion:**  \nThe logical chain forces BE to dislike itself (due to being gentle), which means it **cannot eat the lion** (Statement 18). Therefore, the statement \"The bald eagle eats the lion\" is **False**.\n\n**Answer:** B) False",
