 is C) Unknown.\n</think>\n\nGary is round (fact 7) and kind (fact 6). From fact 11, round things are quiet, so Gary is quiet. Fact 15 states that round and quiet objects must be green, so Gary is green. No rule directly links Gary\u2019s attributes (round, quiet, green, kind) to being young. Fact 12 only states that young things are round, not vice versa. Other rules (facts 13, 14) require redness or other traits Gary lacks. Since there\u2019s no contradiction in assuming Gary isn\u2019t young, and no rule mandates his youth, the status is **unknown**.\n\n**Answer: C) Unknown**",
