 don\u2019t involve Fiona\u2019s color directly.\n\n3. **No Direct or Indirect Constraints on Fiona\u2019s Color**: Fiona\u2019s color isn\u2019t mentioned in the context, and none of the rules force her to be white or non-white. The rules about quietness, greenness, and roughness don\u2019t restrict non-quiet individuals like Fiona from being white or any other color.\n\n4. **Conclusion**: Since there\u2019s no information confirming or denying Fiona\u2019s whiteness, the statement **\"Fiona is white\"** cannot be definitively true or false. Thus, it is **unknown**.\n\n**Answer**: C) Unknown",
